[l_english.STATE_LORE_731]
In Kirin Forest live the residents who have avoided the cycles for the longest time in Kirin history, because they have never established civilization here — all Kirin act alone, farming, gathering, hunting, with almost no interaction, and therefore no contagious anger. Kirin Forest is the most desirable place for archaeologists, and chatting with the indigenous Kirins here can reveal many stories of ancient Kirin civilizations.
The prosperity of the Kirin commune after the Ultimate Battle can be “attributed to” Kirin Forest. When the Kirins busy with the “Silence” had no interest in observing the outside world, the centaur army led by Tirek was the first to knock on the door of this ancient kingdom — but unfortunately, they knocked on the wrong door.
The centaur army entered Kirin Forest, captured several Kirins, mistaking them for slightly smarter beasts with nothing worth plundering, and then turned and left. For years, the centaurs have always believed that the entire Kirin commune consists only of those “uncivilized” Kirins in Kirin Forest, never imagining that there is a brilliant civilization in the south of the forest. Therefore, in ignorance, the Kirin commune was spared from the colonization and plunder of the centaurs, quietly passing the past few years.

[l_simp_chinese.STATE_LORE_731]
麒麟之森里生活着麒麟历史上最长时间避免轮回的居民们，因为他们从未在这里建立文明——所有麒麟都独自行动，耕种、采集、狩猎，几乎没有什么交集，也就不存在传染性的怒火。麒麟之森是考古学家们最向往的地方，与这里的原住民聊上一小会儿，就能得知许多古老麒麟文明的故事。
而麒麟社群能在终末之战后拥有如今的繁荣，不得不“归功于”麒麟之森。当忙于处理“静默”的麒麟还没有兴趣观察外界的世界时，提雷克领导下的半人马军队就首先叩响了这个古老国度的大门——不过可惜的是，他们叩错了门。
半人马的军队进入麒麟之森，抓住了几只麒麟，误以为他们只是稍微聪明些的野兽，没什么值得掠夺的，便转身离去。数年来，半人马们一直认为整个麒麟社群就只有麒麟之森的那些“未开化者”，从未设想过在森林的南方，还有着璀璨的文明。也因此，在毫不知情的情况下，麒麟社群得以免于半人马的殖民与掠夺，安静地度过了过去的几年。
